<!--
    Status-bar icon.

    A silhouette, because Android masks notification icons to a single colour:
    anything with internal detail is destroyed by the mask. The shape is an
    unmistakable microphone rather than a logo, so the notification says what is
    happening. An indicator that a user cannot read at a glance is an indicator
    they will learn to ignore.
-->
